  "notes": {
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l002": "Артылта тууган is rendered as born in succession to Manas; the exact heroic genealogical nuance is uncertain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l014": "Жуушаган is understood contextually as chewing the cud while facing the plain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l017": "The sentinel ram is called the Kalcha khan's trusted ear because it carries warning news.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l009": "Боор таш is retained literally as liver-stone, a second fire-making stone paired with Chinese flint; its precise mineral identity is uncertain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l011": "Милте is rendered as matchcord in the firearm ignition sequence.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l013": "Маша is rendered as a forked gun-rest."
  },
